]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record on the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids runs from 1951 to 2025, and October to November came in under 90% of normal in 43 of those 75 years. In 2025, on the middle of the grids, February to March came in at 6% of normal and November to December at 6% too. So far in 2026, March to April sat at 33% of normal on the middle of the grids. Grid 16016 had its driest year in 2011, at 31% of normal.</p>"}
